From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: steps <steps@local>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:03:35 +0100
Subject: Runs API: todo.updated carries the agent's task list after each Todo
 call

A run-stream client got tool.started / tool.completed for todo_list with no list (the canonical turn's completion has no preview, the other path a 500-character cut of the JSON), so it could not show the plan the agent keeps. After every Todo call that returns a list, the stream now carries todo.updated: the whole list as the call left it (id, content, status, parent), its revision and summary, right after the call's tool.completed; contents secret-redacted. The ACP adapter already sends the same list as a plan update.

Bip-Patch: 0026-runs-todo-updated
---
 gateway/platforms/api_server_runs.py       | 43 +++++++++-
 tests/gateway/test_api_server_runs_todo.py | 98 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 140 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/gateway/test_api_server_runs_todo.py

